# Benchmark run outputs — regenerated by `assemble`, never committed
*/output/
# Preprocessed / working artifacts (markdown flattened from PDF, etc.)
*/work/
# Source documents — official originals are operator-provided and may be
# copyrighted; keep them local, never redistribute. Re-download via the URL
# + date recorded in each case's notes.md.
*/sources/
# Source-quality audit packages — derived from the operator-provided sources
# above (assemble requires one), so they stay local and are never redistributed.
*/source-quality/
# Raw acquired snapshots — same reasoning as sources/ below: vendor HTML that
# may be copyrighted, kept local, re-downloadable via each notes.md.
*/raw/
